---
description: Other skills may give taste or branding guidance; Recording Studio code is always Flatpack
alwaysApply: true
---

Other skills may give taste or branding guidance. Code is always Flatpack ViewComponents, tokens, and named themes.

Never Tailwind, shadcn, GSAP, custom CSS kits, or third-party UI libraries on gem, dummy, or Admin screens.

Dummy default is `html data-theme="rounded"` plus core `UsesDefaultLayout`. Hosts use a named theme (for example `featured-in`), not forked CSS.

If a look is missing, add a Flatpack token or component first. Follow `recording-studio-flatpack` and `recording-studio-ui`.
